---
layout: layouts/inner.njk
title:
  en: "Sustainability & ESG — Growing Responsibly"
  vi: "Phát triển bền vững & ESG"
  zh: "可持续发展与 ESG — 负责任地共同成长"
description:
  en: "Sustainability drives how Nam Viet Group operates — responsible sourcing, people-first partnerships and transparent governance across the ecosystem."
  vi: "Phát triển bền vững là kim chỉ nam vận hành của Nam Việt — nguồn nguyên liệu có trách nhiệm, đồng hành cùng con người và quản trị minh bạch."
  zh: "可持续发展是南越集团的运营准则——负责任采购、以人为本的合作模式与透明治理，贯穿整个产业生态。"
pagination:
  data: locales
  size: 1
  alias: locale
permalink: "{{ localeUrl('/sustainability/', locale) }}"
eyebrow:
  en: Sustainability
  vi: Phát triển bền vững
  zh: 可持续发展
heading:
  en: Growing Together. Responsibly.
  vi: Cùng nhau phát triển. Có trách nhiệm.
  zh: 共同成长。负责任地前行。
lead:
  en: Sustainability is how Nam Viet Group operates — responsible sourcing, people-first partnerships and transparent governance across our agribusiness ecosystem.
  vi: Phát triển bền vững là cách Tập đoàn Nam Việt vận hành — nguồn nguyên liệu có trách nhiệm, đồng hành cùng con người và quản trị minh bạch trong toàn bộ hệ sinh thái nông nghiệp.
  zh: 可持续发展是南越集团的运营方式——负责任采购、以人为本的合作与透明治理，贯穿整个农业产业生态。
---

<nav class="page-subnav" aria-label="Sustainability sections" data-page-subnav>
  <div class="page-subnav__inner">
    <a href="#overview" class="page-subnav__link is-active" data-subnav-target="overview">
      {{ ({ en: 'Overview', vi: 'Tổng quan', zh: '概览' })[locale] }}
    </a>
    {% for pillar in sustainability.pillars %}
    <a
      href="#{{ pillar.id }}"
      class="page-subnav__link"
      data-subnav-target="{{ pillar.id }}"
    >
      <span class="esg-nav__letter" aria-hidden="true">{{ pillar.letter }}</span>
      {{ pillar.title[locale] }}
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
    <a href="#standards" class="page-subnav__link" data-subnav-target="standards">
      {{ ({ en: 'Standards', vi: 'Chuẩn mực', zh: '标准' })[locale] }}
    </a>
  </div>
</nav>

<div class="esg-page">
  <section id="overview" class="esg-page__intro page-panel" data-page-panel="overview">
    <div class="esg-page__banner">
      <img
        src="{{ '/assets/img/sustainability.png' | url }}"
        alt="Sustainable agriculture and responsible operations at Nam Viet Group"
        loading="lazy"
        width="1400"
        height="700"
      >
      <div class="esg-page__banner-veil" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <p class="esg-page__banner-label">
        {{ ({ en: 'ESG framework', vi: 'Khung ESG', zh: 'ESG 框架' })[locale] }}
      </p>
    </div>

    <p class="esg-page__approach">
      {{ sustainability.approach[locale] }}
    </p>

    <ul class="esg-page__principles" aria-label="ESG principles">
      {% for item in sustainability.principles %}
      <li>
        {{ item[locale] }}
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>

    <div class="esg-highlights" aria-label="ESG highlights">
      {% for item in sustainability.highlights %}
      <div class="esg-highlight{% if item.wide %} esg-highlight--wide{% endif %}">
        <p class="esg-highlight__value">{{ item.value }}</p>
        <p class="esg-highlight__label">
          {{ item.label[locale] }}
        </p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="esg-chain" aria-labelledby="esg-chain-title">
    <header class="esg-section__head">
      <h2 id="esg-chain-title">
        {{ sustainability.chain.title[locale] }}
      </h2>
      <p>
        {{ sustainability.chain.lead[locale] }}
      </p>
    </header>
    <ol class="esg-chain__steps">
      {% for step in sustainability.chain.steps %}
      <li class="esg-chain__step">
        <span class="esg-chain__num" aria-hidden="true">{{ step.num }}</span>
        <h3>
          {{ step.title[locale] }}
        </h3>
        <p>
          {{ step.text[locale] }}
        </p>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
  </section>

  <div class="esg-page__pillars">
    {% for pillar in sustainability.pillars %}
    <article
      id="{{ pillar.id }}"
      class="esg-block page-panel"
      data-page-panel="{{ pillar.id }}"
    >
      <div class="esg-block__main">
        <header class="esg-block__head">
          <span class="esg-block__letter" aria-hidden="true">{{ pillar.letter }}</span>
          <div class="esg-block__titles">
            <p class="esg-block__eyebrow">
              {% if locale == 'en' %}Pillar {{ loop.index }}{% elif locale == 'zh' %}支柱 {{ loop.index }}{% else %}Trụ cột {{ loop.index }}{% endif %}
            </p>
            <h2 class="esg-block__title">
              {{ pillar.title[locale] }}
            </h2>
          </div>
        </header>
        <p class="esg-block__lead">
          {{ pillar.lead[locale] }}
        </p>
      </div>
      <ul class="esg-block__list">
        {% for focus in pillar.focuses %}
        <li>
          <span class="esg-block__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          {{ focus[locale] }}
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <section id="standards" class="esg-standards page-panel" data-page-panel="standards">
    <header class="esg-section__head">
      <h2>
        {{ sustainability.standards.title[locale] }}
      </h2>
      <p>
        {{ sustainability.standards.lead[locale] }}
      </p>
    </header>
    <div class="esg-standards__grid">
      {% for item in sustainability.standards.items %}
      <article class="esg-standard">
        <p class="esg-standard__code">{{ item.code }}</p>
        <h3>
          {{ item.title[locale] }}
        </h3>
        <p>
          {{ item.text[locale] }}
        </p>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <aside class="esg-story">
    <div class="esg-story__media">
      <img
        src="{{ '/assets/img/sustainability.png' | url }}"
        alt=""
        loading="lazy"
        width="800"
        height="560"
      >
    </div>
    <div class="esg-story__body">
      <p class="esg-story__eyebrow">
        {{ sustainability.story.eyebrow[locale] }}
      </p>
      <h2>
        {{ sustainability.story.title[locale] }}
      </h2>
      <p>
        {{ sustainability.story.text[locale] }}
      </p>
      <a class="btn btn--solid" href="{{ sustainability.story.href | localeUrl(locale) | url }}">
        {{ sustainability.story.cta[locale] }}
      </a>
    </div>
  </aside>

  <aside class="esg-page__cta">
    <div class="esg-page__cta-copy">
      <h2>
        {{ ({ en: 'Go deeper', vi: 'Tìm hiểu thêm', zh: '深入了解' })[locale] }}
      </h2>
      <p>
        {{ ({ en: 'Download ESG highlights or talk with our team about responsible partnership.', vi: 'Tải điểm nhấn ESG hoặc trao đổi với chúng tôi về hợp tác có trách nhiệm.', zh: '下载 ESG 要点，或与我们讨论负责任的合作。' })[locale] }}
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="esg-page__cta-actions">
      <a class="btn btn--solid" href="{{ '/downloads/'  | localeUrl(locale) | url }}">
        {{ ({ en: 'Download ESG highlights', vi: 'Tải điểm nhấn ESG', zh: '下载 ESG 要点' })[locale] }}
      </a>
      <a class="btn btn--outline btn--dark" href="{{ '/contact/'  | localeUrl(locale) | url }}">
        {{ i18n[locale].contact }}
      </a>
    </div>
  </aside>
</div>
